@startuml
title Building Registration and Viewing Available Buildings

participant "Client Agent" as Client
participant "Building Agent" as Building
participant "Rental Agent" as Rental

== 1. Building Registration ==

note over Building, Rental
The Building Agent sends a heartbeat containing
its name and room data to the Rental Agent.
The Rental Agent registers the building if it
does not already exist in its memory.
end note

Building -> Rental : heartbeat
Rental -> Rental : registerBuilding

loop Every 5 seconds
    Building -> Rental : heartbeat
    Rental -> Rental : markBuildingAlive
end

note over Building, Rental
Heartbeats keep the Rental Agent's building
and room information up to date.
end note

== 2. View Available Buildings ==

note over Client, Rental
The Client Agent requests a list of buildings.
The Rental Agent returns the building information
stored in its memory, rather than querying each
Building Agent directly.

The information is refreshed through heartbeats
every 5 seconds.
end note

Client -> Rental : ListBuildingsRequest
activate Rental

Rental -> Rental : returnAvailableBuildings
Rental --> Client : BuildingsListMessage

deactivate Rental

@enduml
